<h1 data-copy-en="Maize" data-copy-zh="Maize">Maize</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Maize’s bounty recruitment, daily gifts, worker activities and resort progression." data-copy-zh="Maize的悬赏招募、日常礼物、员工活动与度假进展。">Maize’s bounty recruitment, daily gifts, worker activities and resort progression.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Maize</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_and_Recruiting_Maize"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fighters_Guild_Contract_15"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Battle_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_Choices_and_Guild_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Training_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Dungeon_Encounter"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Heart-to-Heart"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Maize"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Shared_Resort_Encounters"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Maize — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maize.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Maize — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maize.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Maize — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Maize joins through a Fighters Guild bounty and then appears in the brothel’s Dungeon. Her character relationship, worker management and resort activities are related but use different menus and requirements.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find Maize</h2><p>Accept Bounty: The Succubus Queen, the fifteenth guild contract. On the ordinary dungeon’s floor 30, eligible movement has a 15% chance to start her bounty encounter. Complete the encounter to recruit her; return to the guild for $800, Clout +10 and two Sylphs. The Infinity Dungeon does not run this bounty.</p><p>After recruitment, visit the brothel Dungeon daily, 09:00–17:00.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Brothel Dungeon</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Condition">active recruited worker</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Use Talk to reach Acquaintance (50), when Chocolate and Flowers become available. The resort’s Sunset Walk is her personal heart-to-heart; it belongs to an active vacation rather than the ordinary Dungeon portrait.</p><p>Her two later worker-training upgrades require In Love (3000). One follows recruitment; the other also requires the resort Sunset Walk. These encounters unlock their respective crafting/training upgrades, rather than granting a fully upgraded worker immediately.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Convenient</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Brothel Dungeon; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after An Unexpected Visit; active recruited worker: Maize; not vacationing: Maize / Raven</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Esperanza +4 / Maize +3 / Raven +3</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_Portrait,_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_Portrait.2C_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Session_Talk,_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Session_Talk.2C_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafting_the_Required_Gifts"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk takes 20 minutes and gives 1 base point, three safe uses daily. Chocolate takes 10 minutes and one Chocolate for 5 base points; Flowers takes 10 minutes and one Flowers for 8 base points. Each gift has a separate once-daily allowance.</p><p>Use her worker menu for praise, paid visits and training. Crafted training upgrades use their own equipment and material requirements; the Brothel guide explains the common rules. The resort adds meals, relaxation, spa and beach activities during a supported vacation.</p><p>Listed relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers can change the final gain. Daily allowances for the same action follow the character across locations; starting it elsewhere does not create a fresh allowance.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Charm 70 / Mystic 70 / Communication 70</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Mystic Seduction</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Brothel Dungeon; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Brothel Dungeon; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Chocolate ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +5; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Brothel Dungeon; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Flowers ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +8; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Sunset Walk with Maize</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">53</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>A random Balrog encounter is not Maize’s recruitment event. Check the active guild bounty, ordinary floor 30 and an unfinished bounty encounter. Her daytime portrait requires her to be an active worker; a vacation can temporarily move her elsewhere.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">Fighters Guild</a> · <a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Brothel operations</a> · <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_and_Recruiting_Maize"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fighters_Guild_Contract_15"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Battle_Preparation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_Choices_and_Guild_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Training_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Dungeon_Encounter"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Heart-to-Heart"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Maize"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Shared_Resort_Encounters"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Maize 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maize.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Maize 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/maize.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Maize 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Maize通过战士公会悬赏加入，之后会在青楼的地牢出现。个人关系、员工管理和度假活动彼此相关，但入口与条件各不相同。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>接取公会第15份委托悬赏：魅魔女王。在普通地下城第30层移动时，每次符合条件的移动有15%概率触发她的悬赏事件。完成后可招募她，再回公会领取800财富、声望+10和两个小天使。无限地下城不会触发这份悬赏。</p><p>招募后，每天09:00—17:00前往青楼地牢见她。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">地牢</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">已招募且员工启用</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先靠交谈达到相识（50），再开放巧克力和鲜花礼物。度假中的日落漫步是她的个人谈心，入口属于正在进行的假期，不在普通地牢头像里。</p><p>两项后期员工训练升级都要求恋爱中（3000）。其中一项接在招募之后，另一项还要求完成度假中的日落漫步。相关事件开放各自的制作与训练升级，不会直接将整名员工升至最高等级。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">正方便</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">地牢; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：意料之外的造访；已招募且员工启用：Maize；未在度假：Maize、Raven</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Esperanza +4、Maize +3、Raven +3</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_Portrait,_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_Portrait.2C_Talk_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Session_Talk,_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Session_Talk.2C_Praise_and_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafting_the_Required_Gifts"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈消耗20分钟，获得1点基础关系，每日安全额度3次。巧克力消耗10分钟及一份巧克力，获得5点基础关系；鲜花消耗10分钟及一份鲜花，获得8点直接关系。两种礼物各自每日一次。</p><p>赞扬、付费拜访与训练在员工菜单中进行。制作训练升级还有独立的装备和材料要求，共通规则见青楼指南。符合条件的假期中还会开放用餐、休息、水疗与海滩活动。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，所列关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量会受共通关系修正影响。同一动作的每日额度跟随角色计算，换地点不会获得新额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">魅力 70、神秘 70、沟通 70</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">神秘诱惑</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地牢; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；3次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地牢; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；巧克力 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+5；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地牢; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；鲜花 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+8；1次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Maize 的日落散步</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">53</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>随机遭遇Balrog并不是Maize的招募事件。请确认已接取对应悬赏、身处普通地下城第30层，而且尚未完成她的悬赏事件。白天头像要求她仍是已启用的员工；度假期间她可能暂时前往别处。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">战士公会</a> · <a href="game-systems-brothel.html">青楼经营</a> · <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">塞壬岛度假村</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a></p></section>
